# Pin line endings to LF for every text file this repo tracks, regardless
# of which OS/editor touches it. Without this, editing a file from a
# Windows-side tool (vs. WSL/Linux) silently rewrites its line endings on
# save, turning an unrelated one-line change into a whole-file diff — this
# has already happened once across ~80 files in this repo's history.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
